gametitle=Final Fantasy X International [SLPS-25088] (J) [658597E2]

[Force English]
comment=Forces the game to use English at all times.
patch=1,EE,0031ce5e,byte,00000001

[Sensor Always On]
comment=Freezes the game when fighting a mimic in the Omega Ruins.
patch=1,EE,00316FB5,byte,00000001

[Distribute AP to Inactive Party Members]
comment=Controls whether or not a certain character "appeared" in battle, and "acted" in battle. A character must both appear and act in order to gain AP. This works for characters who haven't joined the party yet.
